              "B": "A commercial pharmacy delivery route is private business operations, not an international sovereign treaty.",
              "C": "Prescription delivery is a functional commercial service, not a religious or linguistic vernacular territory.",
              "D": "A climax community is a biological ecological concept, wholly unrelated to pharmacy delivery zones."
